      m_Calls: []
  lines:
  - npcText: I hope you will get well soon sir, you look terrible, like a 2020s AI...
      Those programs were messed up, no doctors managed to cure them. The worst of
      these poor programs was Daedal, I supposed you've heard of her... Ok enough,
      let me work now.
    answers:
    - text: I... Sure.
      nextLineIndex: -1
